    "Rates are indicative GBP figures, excluding duty, VAT, insurance and platform fee.",
    "SEA_LCL: rate.perCbm applies per weight-or-measure revenue ton (1 CBM or 1,000 kg, whichever is greater); rate.minimum applies.",
    "SEA_FCL: per container; containers are inferred from volume (20ft ≤ 28 CBM, 40ft ≤ 58 CBM) unless specified.",
    "AIR: rate.perKg applies to chargeable weight = max(actual kg, CBM × 1,000,000 / 6,000).",
    "ukHaulage is the post-border leg (excluded from the customs value, included in the VAT base).",
    "clearanceFee is customs brokerage (post-border).",
    "Refresh cadence: fortnightly. Bump the version on every change; never edit a published version in place."
  ],
